{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "_comment": [
    "Checked in on purpose: these grants ARE the project's shipping policy and should",
    "travel with the repo, not live in one machine's settings.local.json. The matching",
    "prose is CLAUDE.md section 'Shipping \u2014 what a session may do without asking'.",
    "",
    "Push rules are SCOPED, never a blanket Bash(git push:*).",
    "",
    "LIMIT, not papered over: Bash rules are PREFIX matches, so the deny list below",
    "cannot catch a --force placed at the END of a command. Forbidding force-push is",
    "prose in CLAUDE.md; this file cannot enforce it.",
    "",
    "GitHub Pages: the push to main IS the deploy. Org repo (Exeter CSS)."
  ],
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(git status:*)",
      "Bash(git diff:*)",
      "Bash(git log:*)",
      "Bash(git show:*)",
      "Bash(git branch:*)",
      "Bash(git remote:*)",
      "Bash(git rev-parse:*)",
      "Bash(git rev-list:*)",
      "Bash(git describe:*)",
      "Bash(git verify-tag:*)",
      "Bash(git fetch:*)",
      "Bash(git worktree:*)",
      "Bash(git check-ignore:*)",
      "Bash(git add:*)",
      "Bash(git commit:*)",
      "Bash(git switch:*)",
      "Bash(git checkout:*)",
      "Bash(git merge:*)",
      "Bash(git merge --no-ff:*)",
      "Bash(git tag:*)",
      "Bash(git push origin feature/:*)",
      "Bash(git push -u origin feature/:*)",
      "Bash(git push --set-upstream origin feature/:*)",
      "Bash(git push origin fix/:*)",
      "Bash(git push -u origin fix/:*)",
      "Bash(git push origin hotfix/:*)",
      "Bash(git push origin main)",
      "Bash(git push origin main --tags)",
      "Bash(git push origin --tags)",
      "Bash(git push origin develop main --tags)",
      "Bash(git push origin --follow-tags)",
      "Bash(gh run list:*)",
      "Bash(gh run view:*)",
      "Bash(gh run watch:*)",
      "Bash(gh workflow run:*)",
      "Bash(gh workflow list:*)",
      "Bash(curl -s -o /dev/null -w:*)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Bash(git push --force:*)",
      "Bash(git push -f:*)",
      "Bash(git push --force-with-lease:*)",
      "Bash(git push origin --force:*)",
      "Bash(git push origin -f:*)",
      "Bash(git push origin +:*)",
      "Bash(git reset --hard origin/:*)"
    ]
  }
}
